+// refreshes fire on every AX notification (including the flood during a window drag). A blind depth-first walk costs up
+// to thousands of AX IPC round-trips per window; breadth-first with an early exit costs a few dozen in the common case,
+// and the node budgets cap the worst case. See https://github.com/nikitabobko/AeroSpace/issues/68
